  "status": "active",
  "summary": "RPO C07 auxiliary hardtop (removable hard top for the convertible 19467): contents of the option and the rear hold-down at the body (View A). A bracket is bolted to the body panel with a screw up from below into a nut assembly; a screw through the bracket threads into a special nut, locked by a nut, to catch the top. A chart-cover (instruction cover) is fastened with a rivet and lock washer into two holes drilled using the bracket as template. Other sheets: A2 front & side molding & weatherstrip, A3 rear molding & weatherstrip, A4 headliner & trim, A5/A6 top attachments, A7/A8 side door glass adjustment.",
